  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Delete TACOTS Feedback Record

  Permanently deletes a single TACOTS feedback record by its unique identifier. The corresponding cache entry is also invalidated.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `delete` permission.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                            |
  |-----------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS feedback record     |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Confirms the feedback record has been deleted.

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `delete` permission.                 |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
